  "job_B9.2.7_20251003_115004": {
    "chunk_text": "ron, forhergedon Italiam o\u00fe rafennan \u00fea burg; & Sw\u00e6fas Toeacan \u00fe\u00e6m Romane h\u00e6fdon gewin betuh him selfum. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Gallienus wear\u00f0 ofslagen on Medialane \u00fe\u00e6re byrig from his agnum monnum. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s M wintra & XXV, feng Claudius to Romana onwalde. \u00dey ilcan geare he oferwon Gotan, & hie adraf ut of Crecum. & him Romane gedydan \u00e6nne gyldenne scield, \u00fe\u00e6re d\u00e6da to weor\u00f0mynte, & ane gyldene \u00de\u00e6s on \u00fe\u00e6m \u00e6fterran geare he gefor, & his bro\u00feor Quintillus feng to \u00fe\u00e6m onwalde. & \u00fe\u00e6s on \u00fe\u00e6m seofonteo\u00fean d\u00e6ge he wear\u00f0 ofslagen. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s M wintra & XXVII, feng Aurelius to Romana & adraf Gotan be nor\u00fean Donua, & \u00feonan for on Sirie, & hie geniedde eft to Romana onwalde. & si\u00fe\u00fean he for on Gallie, & ofslog Tetricum \u00feone mon, for \u00fey \u00fee he hi him teah to anwalde. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m he bebead cristenra monna ehtnesse, & ra\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s wear\u00fe ofslagen. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s M wintra & XXXII, feng Tacitus to Romana onwalde, \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Floriam feng to \u00fe\u00e6m onwalde, & w\u00e6s ofslagen \u00fe\u00e6s on \u00fe\u00e6m \u00feriddan mon\u00fee on \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg w\u00e6s getimbred M wintra & XXXIII, feng Brobus to Romana onwalde, & he adyde Hunas of Gallium. & he ofslog Saturninus, \u00fee \u00e6fter \u00fe",
